# Antigravity Persistent Plans & Local State
artifacts
artifacts/
artifacts/plans/
# codeloop / agyloop ephemeral runtime state
# Bare `.agyloop` (restored in #102, dropped by #216/#217) is the only rule that matches the state
# dir when it is a SYMLINK: git stores it as mode 120000 -- a file -- so every `.agyloop/...` rule
# below silently misses it. No trailing slash on purpose: a trailing slash matches directories only
# and would NOT match a symlink. Scoped to this repo's own working tree; INIT_GITIGNORE_RULES (used
# to scaffold *consumer* projects) still emits granular rules only, so `.agyloop/config.json`
# remains trackable there.
.agyloop
.codeloop/state.json
.codeloop/tasks/
.codeloop/locks/
.codeloop/logs/
.codeloop/critique-update-cache.json
.codeloop/*.bak
.agyloop/state.json
.agyloop/tasks/
.agyloop/locks/
.agyloop/logs/
.agyloop/critique-update-cache.json
.agyloop/*.bak
.worktrees/
/config.json

